  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Genesis 19: 1-2 (live - okc 9.17.21)**: rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Pink and Blue (live - okc 9.17.21)**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 3 archived performances [4]\n- **Horseradish Road (live - okc 9.17.21)**: back after 61 archived shows (1245 days); rare: 14 archived performances [4]\n- **Waving at You (live - okc 9.17.21)**: back after 37 archived shows (791 days); rare: 12 archived performances [4]\n- **Picture of My Dress (live - okc 9.17.21)**: rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Before I Got There (live - okc 9.17.21) [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2021-09-17.aud.h2.flac24** (recommended): audience recording; 24 songs; 93 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **tmg2021-09-17**: source not stated; 23 songs; 93 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2021-09-17.aud.h2.flac24**: taped by poormoon; source: Zoom H2 (internal mics, front) > WAV (24/48) [1]. Also: Recorded with a Zoom H2 using its internal mics, captured at 24-bit/48kHz; Mic placement was very close to the far left stage PA, about six inches to a foot in front; Processed in REAPER with EQ and multiband compression, then exported as 24/48 FLAC [1]\n- **tmg2021-09-17**: taped by Liz Hamilton; transferred by Liz Hamilton; source: iPhone 7 internal microphone [2]",
